    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepest World is a coding sandbox MMORPG where you can write your character's AI with JavaScript. Explore a 3D open world, hunt monsters, gather resources, craft deep builds and items, acquire programming skills, grind 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to program a bot that plays the game for you. To do so, we provide you with a client-side web API which exposes data objects that represent your surroundings, API call functions to communicate with the server, and some utility functions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in the relatively early stages of development, and many features are being designed, implemented, and tested. As such, you may encounter bugs, unfinished content, or changes to gameplay mechanics. Your feedback and bug reports are always welcome and greatly appreciated. Thank you for your understanding and support as the game continues to be improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Scripting with Deepest World JavaScript API</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A non-instanced procedurally generated 3D open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A single server that can support hundreds of concurrent players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated skills and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and group PVE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting, farming and gathering professions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncapped levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepest World is a coding sandbox MMORPG where you can write your character's AI with JavaScript. Explore a 3D open world, hunt monsters, gather resources, craft deep builds and items, acquire programming skills, grind 24/7.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to program a bot that plays the game for you. To do so, we provide you with a client-side web API which exposes data objects that represent your surroundings, API call functions to communicate with the server, and some utility functions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in the relatively early stages of development, and many features are being designed, implemented, and tested. As such, you may encounter bugs, unfinished content, or changes to gameplay mechanics. Your feedback and bug reports are always welcome and greatly appreciated. Thank you for your understanding and support as the game continues to be improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Scripting with Deepest World JavaScript API</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A non-instanced procedurally generated 3D open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A single server that can support hundreds of concurrent players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated skills and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and group PVE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crafting, farming and gathering professions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncapped levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions</p></li></ul>",
